{"version":2,"slug":"explore-a-famous-art-store-and-enjoy-italian-food-in-venice-beach-los-angeles","videoId":"OlMfX6j-Zyo","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/OlMfX6j-Zyo","lang":"en","title":"Explore a famous art store and enjoy Italian food in Venice Beach, Los Angeles!","category":"Vlog","channel":"Slow English Vlog","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":1,"text":"Hello everyone. Welcome to a new episode"},{"start":4,"text":"of Bow's Slow English. It's been a while"},{"start":9,"text":"since I've posted a vlog uh just touring"},{"start":14,"text":"around Los Angeles. There was a"},{"start":18,"text":"devastating fire near me called"},{"start":22,"text":"Palisades fire and it allowed us to or I"},{"start":27,"text":"should say it did not allow us to go"},{"start":30,"text":"outside because it's very toxic and"},{"start":35,"text":"there were a lot of there was a lot of"},{"start":38,"text":"ash and smoke."},{"start":41,"text":"So, tonight we are finally going out. We"},{"start":45,"text":"are going to a restaurant called Felix."},{"start":50,"text":"It's one of my favorite Italian"},{"start":53,"text":"restaurants located in Venice,"},{"start":56,"text":"California."},{"start":58,"text":"And before that, we are going to an art"},{"start":62,"text":"supply store called Blick so that my"},{"start":66,"text":"husband can buy some watercolor. Come"},{"start":69,"text":"along."},{"start":71,"text":"If you look straight ahead,"},{"start":73,"text":"you can see how gray the sky is."},{"start":79,"text":"And sometimes"},{"start":81,"text":"when we're driving, we can see the fog"},{"start":84,"text":"right in front of us."},{"start":88,"text":"This area is called Santa Monica."},{"start":92,"text":"I've filmed in Santa Monica many times"},{"start":96,"text":"before,"},{"start":97,"text":"but probably not this area."},{"start":101,"text":"And in American English, we don't"},{"start":104,"text":"normally pronounce the T in"},{"start":108,"text":"Santa."},{"start":110,"text":"It's Santa Monica is how we would"},{"start":113,"text":"normally pronounce it."},{"start":115,"text":"We are almost at the art supply store."},{"start":119,"text":"The reason why he's purchasing"},{"start":122,"text":"watercolor is because I bought him an"},{"start":126,"text":"online"},{"start":128,"text":"painting course"},{"start":130,"text":"specifically using watercolor."},{"start":133,"text":"And the course specializes in"},{"start":138,"text":"architecture."},{"start":139,"text":"So, I'm hoping that he could take one of"},{"start":143,"text":"our old photographs from our travels,"},{"start":147,"text":"maybe"},{"start":148,"text":"in Paris, and use that as inspiration"},{"start":153,"text":"and paint one of the Parisian buildings"},{"start":157,"text":"that we've seen."},{"start":159,"text":"We are hopping on the freeway."},{"start":163,"text":"Wow, somebody is walking on the freeway."},{"start":167,"text":"This freeway is called the 10."},{"start":171,"text":"And as you can see,"},{"start":174,"text":"there is only one lane available to"},{"start":178,"text":"drive on"},{"start":180,"text":"probably because the"},{"start":183,"text":"PCH, which is Pacific Coast Highway,"},{"start":188,"text":"is blocked off due to the fire."},{"start":193,"text":"Luckily, the fire is"},{"start":196,"text":"put out, it's done,"},{"start":198,"text":"but there is a lot of damage. We"},{"start":202,"text":"have taken"},{"start":205,"text":"the off-ramp"},{"start":207,"text":"and"},{"start":209,"text":"we are about to turn onto Lincoln"},{"start":213,"text":"Boulevard,"},{"start":214,"text":"which is a"},{"start":216,"text":"long"},{"start":218,"text":"road"},{"start":219,"text":"that runs north to south."},{"start":223,"text":"There is a new"},{"start":226,"text":"maybe apartment complex that is getting"},{"start":229,"text":"built. Okay, so the crane"},{"start":233,"text":"Let me zoom in."},{"start":236,"text":"is in the fog. It's very foggy."},{"start":240,"text":"I believe fog is a mixture of cool and"},{"start":246,"text":"warm air."},{"start":249,"text":"Feel free to comment if I'm wrong."},{"start":252,"text":"And please don't forget to like and"},{"start":256,"text":"subscribe to my channel."},{"start":259,"text":"If you like this video, give it a thumbs"},{"start":263,"text":"up and that is your way of communicating"},{"start":268,"text":"to me that you like this content."},{"start":272,"text":"We are in the art supply store"},{"start":276,"text":"called Blick."},{"start":278,"text":"And"},{"start":280,"text":"let's see what we have."},{"start":283,"text":"This is liquid dyes."},{"start":287,"text":"Dyes are used to"},{"start":290,"text":"change the color of"},{"start":293,"text":"fabric, really of anything."},{"start":298,"text":"We have cherry red,"},{"start":300,"text":"scarlet,"},{"start":302,"text":"wine,"},{"start":304,"text":"pedal pink,"},{"start":306,"text":"many colors."},{"start":310,"text":"We have some"},{"start":312,"text":"dresser organizers."},{"start":320,"text":"Many different types of"},{"start":322,"text":"pencils,"},{"start":324,"text":"specifically chalk pastel colored"},{"start":328,"text":"pencil."},{"start":330,"text":"Where's my husband?"},{"start":334,"text":"There he is."},{"start":337,"text":"This is the watercolor aisle, I'm"},{"start":340,"text":"assuming."},{"start":342,"text":"Times have evolved"},{"start":345,"text":"and changed."},{"start":347,"text":"And watercolor now comes in little"},{"start":350,"text":"tubes."},{"start":352,"text":"Or maybe it's always been like that"},{"start":355,"text":"and I had no idea because I'm not a"},{"start":357,"text":"painter."},{"start":360,"text":"These watercolors are locked up."},{"start":365,"text":"This is a padlock."},{"start":367,"text":"They must be very expensive."},{"start":372,"text":"They're called"},{"start":375,"text":"Daniel Smith extra fine watercolors."},{"start":380,"text":"Can anyone tell me what makes them"},{"start":384,"text":"so special?"},{"start":385,"text":"I would love to know."},{"start":388,"text":"What's your favorite color?"},{"start":392,"text":"My favorite color is green."},{"start":397,"text":"Like my jacket."},{"start":404,"text":"This is a different type of paint called"},{"start":407,"text":"acrylic."},{"start":410,"text":"I have no idea"},{"start":412,"text":"what the difference is between"},{"start":415,"text":"soft body acrylic and heavy body"},{"start":420,"text":"acrylic."},{"start":423,"text":"Our most intensely pigmented paint."},{"start":426,"text":"Solid, flat, matte."},{"start":429,"text":"No brush strokes, no cracking. No need"},{"start":434,"text":"to dilute."},{"start":436,"text":"This tiny watercolor set of six colors"},{"start":441,"text":"is $40 and $0.99."},{"start":445,"text":"That's very expensive."},{"start":447,"text":"This art supply store"},{"start":450,"text":"offers framing."},{"start":453,"text":"I've actually brought a piece of art"},{"start":457,"text":"that I created and had it custom framed"},{"start":461,"text":"here. Skateboards."},{"start":464,"text":"Random. I think this is my husband's"},{"start":467,"text":"favorite"},{"start":469,"text":"aisle."},{"start":473,"text":"Because he used to do graffiti."},{"start":476,"text":"We are driving through"},{"start":479,"text":"our old neighborhood."},{"start":482,"text":"We used to live around here."},{"start":488,"text":"We call this our old stomping grounds."},{"start":493,"text":"It is an idiom"},{"start":495,"text":"meaning that we used to live here."},{"start":499,"text":"This is Rose Avenue"},{"start":502,"text":"which is a popular"},{"start":506,"text":"neighborhood"},{"start":508,"text":"and tourist"},{"start":510,"text":"street."},{"start":512,"text":"I've always wanted to go to that"},{"start":514,"text":"restaurant, but I keep forgetting. It's"},{"start":517,"text":"called Wallflower"},{"start":519,"text":"and I believe it's Indonesian food."},{"start":524,"text":"There are many people on bikes in this"},{"start":527,"text":"area."},{"start":532,"text":"That is a Mexican restaurant."},{"start":537,"text":"Venice Beach Wines"},{"start":539,"text":"is a wine bar with some snacks."},{"start":546,"text":"Bluestone Lane is an Australian"},{"start":551,"text":"bistro."},{"start":554,"text":"Flake is a popular breakfast restaurant."},{"start":558,"text":"Moon Juice"},{"start":560,"text":"sells organic"},{"start":562,"text":"fresh pressed juices."},{"start":567,"text":"American Beauty"},{"start":569,"text":"has delicious burgers."},{"start":574,"text":"That's a new store."},{"start":576,"text":"It's"},{"start":578,"text":"also a new store."},{"start":580,"text":"This is a barber shop."},{"start":583,"text":"This is"},{"start":585,"text":"one of the Google buildings."},{"start":590,"text":"Do you know about Gold's Gym?"},{"start":594,"text":"It's a very popular"},{"start":596,"text":"gym for bodybuilders."},{"start":599,"text":"Arnold Schwarzenegger"},{"start":601,"text":"made it famous."},{"start":604,"text":"These are"},{"start":606,"text":"lofts."},{"start":608,"text":"They call them"},{"start":610,"text":"work live lofts, actually live work"},{"start":615,"text":"lofts"},{"start":616,"text":"is what they call it."},{"start":618,"text":"Oh,"},{"start":619,"text":"there is a CrossFit here still."},{"start":625,"text":"Venice is known to be"},{"start":629,"text":"home to many creative people."},{"start":635,"text":"We are approaching"},{"start":638,"text":"Abbot Kinney,"},{"start":641,"text":"which is"},{"start":643,"text":"once and maybe still considered"},{"start":646,"text":"one of the coolest streets in the United"},{"start":650,"text":"States,"},{"start":652,"text":"according to GQ magazine."},{"start":656,"text":"I have no idea why I know that fact."},{"start":663,"text":"To the right is the beach."},{"start":665,"text":"We are just a stone's throw away from"},{"start":669,"text":"the beach, which is an idiom"},{"start":673,"text":"meaning we are very close to the beach."},{"start":680,"text":"Now we are parallel parking."},{"start":684,"text":"And the restaurant is straight ahead"},{"start":689,"text":"past that crosswalk."},{"start":693,"text":"This restaurant over here"},{"start":696,"text":"is new."},{"start":698,"text":"I don't know about it. It's called"},{"start":700,"text":"Alissa,"},{"start":701,"text":"but it used to be a fully plant-based"},{"start":705,"text":"restaurant, which means that all of"},{"start":708,"text":"their dishes are"},{"start":711,"text":"have no meat,"},{"start":713,"text":"and it's basically just vegetables. Very"},{"start":717,"text":"expensive, not that delicious."},{"start":721,"text":"This is"},{"start":723,"text":"an elementary school,"},{"start":726,"text":"which means that they have maybe"},{"start":728,"text":"kindergarten"},{"start":730,"text":"through fifth grade."},{"start":735,"text":"We are going to"},{"start":738,"text":"press this button"},{"start":740,"text":"so that we can"},{"start":743,"text":"signal the light. Does that make sense?"},{"start":746,"text":"So, that the lights"},{"start":747,"text":"can flash and we can cross"},{"start":750,"text":"safely."},{"start":752,"text":"Oh, okay. They're honking for us to go."},{"start":758,"text":"And I'm going to wave to say thank you."},{"start":765,"text":"Okay."},{"start":766,"text":"Here is the restaurant."},{"start":770,"text":"I think they repainted since we've been."},{"start":774,"text":"Anyway, it's called Felix."},{"start":777,"text":"I don't think they're open yet."},{"start":780,"text":"Oh, Atla."},{"start":783,"text":"There is an Atla in New York, and I've"},{"start":785,"text":"been there. So, I guess they opened a"},{"start":789,"text":"Los Angeles location."},{"start":793,"text":"Look."},{"start":795,"text":"Chickens."},{"start":797,"text":"Can you see?"},{"start":798,"text":"Oh, let's see if I can"},{"start":800,"text":"get closer."},{"start":802,"text":"They're so cute."},{"start":805,"text":"Hi, chicken."},{"start":810,"text":"Look at that chicken back there eating"},{"start":812,"text":"the dangling cabbage."},{"start":816,"text":"This is new."},{"start":818,"text":"It's called"},{"start":820,"text":"Albion Garden."},{"start":824,"text":"And they have"},{"start":827,"text":"hot drinks, cold drinks,"},{"start":831,"text":"avocado toast,"},{"start":833,"text":"egg sandwich."},{"start":835,"text":"I think it's Japanese inspired"},{"start":838,"text":"because of all the matcha."},{"start":842,"text":"We are going to have to come back to"},{"start":845,"text":"this restaurant. This is where the"},{"start":847,"text":"chickens were."},{"start":851,"text":"Fresh organic eggs."},{"start":854,"text":"Garden shop, animal animal sanctuary."},{"start":861,"text":"Cute."},{"start":864,"text":"That's where you order food."},{"start":872,"text":"We've sat down"},{"start":874,"text":"and we have the view of the kitchen"},{"start":881,"text":"or a part of the kitchen."},{"start":885,"text":"I am starving."},{"start":889,"text":"What are we going to order?"},{"start":894,"text":"I really like their"},{"start":897,"text":"focaccia bread."},{"start":901,"text":"I also really like their"},{"start":905,"text":"fiori di zucca"},{"start":907,"text":"which is"},{"start":909,"text":"um squash blossoms."},{"start":912,"text":"Hello."},{"start":912.6,"text":"Hi."},{"start":914,"text":"Can I get you started with the flat"},{"start":915,"text":"water, sparkling or Pellegrino? Um flat."},{"start":918,"text":"Do you have flat house water? Yeah, our"},{"start":920,"text":"filtered flat. that. Yes, thank you."},{"start":924,"text":"So, the server just asked if we wanted"},{"start":929,"text":"flat or sparkling water."},{"start":932,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":935,"text":"And then if it's all right with you, I'm"},{"start":936,"text":"just going to wait for your second to"},{"start":937,"text":"come back. Oh, yeah, sure. Thank you."},{"start":940,"text":"We are celebrating our anniversary and"},{"start":943,"text":"they brought out"},{"start":945,"text":"a complimentary"},{"start":947,"text":"glass of"},{"start":950,"text":"maybe champagne,"},{"start":952,"text":"bubbly."},{"start":955,"text":"Cheers."},{"start":958,"text":"We received the bread, focaccia,"},{"start":962,"text":"and the squash blossom, which is fried"},{"start":966,"text":"with some ricotta cheese in it."},{"start":972,"text":"We received the tagliatelle"},{"start":975,"text":"ragu."},{"start":978,"text":"What do you say?"},{"start":980,"text":"Bolognese?"},{"start":982,"text":"Bon appetit. I think that's French."},{"start":987,"text":"Go ahead."},{"start":992,"text":"Let's see"},{"start":993,"text":"the technique."},{"start":996,"text":"Okay, so he's cutting it up"},{"start":999,"text":"with his spoon."},{"start":1006,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1012,"text":"And the last course that we ordered is"},{"start":1015,"text":"called cacio e pepe,"},{"start":1018,"text":"which I think just means salt and"},{"start":1020,"text":"pepper."},{"start":1021,"text":"They warned us that the pasta is very al"},{"start":1026,"text":"dente. Oh, thank you."},{"start":1028,"text":"They just brought"},{"start":1030,"text":"a to-go box with our previous pasta"},{"start":1033,"text":"because we were starting to get full."},{"start":1037,"text":"Enjoy."},{"start":1038,"text":"I better hurry up and film this. They"},{"start":1040,"text":"brought out free ice cream for"},{"start":1042,"text":"anniversary."},{"start":1043,"text":"Blow out the candle."},{"start":1045,"text":"Me? One, two, three."},{"start":1048,"text":"You want this stuff? Okay. Happy"},{"start":1050,"text":"anniversary."},{"start":1053,"text":"We just finished dinner"},{"start":1057,"text":"and we're heading home."},{"start":1059,"text":"I have a lot of work to do when I get"},{"start":1063,"text":"home."},{"start":1064,"text":"So, I'm going to shut my brain off now"},{"start":1069,"text":"and end this video."},{"start":1072,"text":"Thank you for watching."},{"start":1074,"text":"And again, please don't forget to like"},{"start":1078,"text":"and subscribe."},{"start":1079,"text":"See you next time."}]}